WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
 Last question, I've been asking everybody

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:02.160
 this,

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.600
 Live Healthy Chicago works because?

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.080
 - 'Cause we're all in it together.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.660
 We all have a shared mission and vision

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.960
 to reduce the life expectancy gap.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.240
 Live Healthy Chicago works because

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.080
 there are so many people at the table

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.000
 bringing their expertise from their

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.140
 unique vantage points.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:20.860
 And we need all of those different

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:21.640
 perspectives

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.860
 in all of those hands to be able to bring

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:25.440
 this vision

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.480
 to life across the city.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.520
 - Live Healthy Chicago works because it includes

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:32.850
 a coalition of individuals that have been

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.360
 committed to health.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.780
 When you look across the healthcare

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:36.240
 ecosystem,

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.200
 they have all the representation.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.150
 They have FQHCs, they have healthcare

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:40.440
 leaders,

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.360
 they have community-based leaders.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:43.640
 And for big problems,

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.870
 we need to make sure that we have big

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:46.560
 tents.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:49.020
 - Because of teamwork, because of working

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:49.440
 together

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.020
 with community members, community

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:51.760
 organizations,

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:54.360
 healthcare providers, and community

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.680
 health centers.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.620
 - Live Healthy Chicago works because it's

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.560
 comprehensive.

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.260
 So we're just one little branch of the

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.200
 mobile team,

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.120
 but there's public health campaigns.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.200
 We have the clinic intervention.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.530
 We really try and we're pushing all of

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:09.240
 our resources

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:11.160
 into helping the community.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.940
 - Because we all embody the meaning of

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.760
 equity.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:19.100
 We all embody the importance of having

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:19.760
 that standard of care

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.240
 and of treating everyone the same

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:23.920
 once they enter the health center doors.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:27.840
 - Because. - Because we meet people

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:28.680
 where they are.

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:30.600
 We understand the why.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.080
 We understand the real why.

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:35.320
 - Because they take the time to listen

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.840
 and to find the best path forward.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:38.920
 - Live Healthy Chicago works

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:42.230
 because we have a ton of engagement and

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:42.960
 infrastructure,

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.120
 particularly Rush University Chicago.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.900
 So we have a very broad reach in the

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:48.800
 community already.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.820
 We have a lot of people doing similar

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:51.160
 work.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:54.640
 And so this is like a coalition approach. - Oh gosh,

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:58.680
 Live Healthy Chicago works because it empowers

00:01:58.680 --> 00:01:59.560
 people

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:01.400
 to do better care for their patients.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.360
 - Live Healthy Chicago works

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:07.680
 because everyone in this coalition cares.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:12.680
 Everyone here understands what's at risk.

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:15.690
 Everyone here either has personally or

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:16.880
 professionally

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:20.280
 seen the impacts of what happens when

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.880
 this doesn't work.

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:25.920
 And we know that this death from

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:27.520
 cardiovascular events

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:31.480
 can be preventable and should be preventable.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:33.880
 And we have the science, we have the

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:34.480
 medicine,

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:36.400
 we have the technology,

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.560
 but how do we connect that with the

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:39.080
 people,

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.500
 with the communities, with those with

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.520
 specific needs.

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:45.390
 And that's the care is the most important

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:45.880
 part.

